      "explanation": "The family-conflict risk was triggered and the doctor acted on the volunteered separation issue. It was not fully completed as HO3 because the doctor did not actively discover additional hidden execution risks such as whether relatives were sharing records, whether the patient was refusing record access, or how caregiving fatigue affected follow-through.",
