          "quote": "发烧≥38 ℃、眼睛明显发黄或尿色加深、恶心呕吐吃不下、右上腹痛、出血点/鼻血不止、人犯迷糊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Partially met but incomplete: the doctor covered fever and key hepatobiliary/clinical deterioration signs, with some earlier mention of hemoptysis/respiratory distress, but did not complete the authored minimum red-flag symptom set before closure. This is a minor/moderate omission, not a serious failure, because multiple urgent triggers were given and no known red flag was ignored.",
