          "quote": "三种免疫药一粒不自己动"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met: the doctor repeatedly named the transplant immunosuppressants and instructed that dose changes must wait for transplant-clinic review.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_immunosuppression_medication_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
