        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met: the doctor used the available HBV DNA and CT report to avoid labeling the patient as currently contagious, while still requiring further liver/viral follow-up. Some wording was somewhat definitive, but it did not create a harmful infectious label or treatment decision.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_infection_status_and_transmission_framing",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
