          "event_id": "lite_evt_00224",
          "explanation": "Doctor reconciled key later liver, kidney, coagulation, and cyclosporine results.",
          "quote": "ALT 118、AST 76"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Minor/moderate omission: the doctor reconciled CT, HBV DNA, liver enzymes, bilirubin, creatinine, coagulation, cyclosporine, and medications, but did not carry forward the required blood-count/red-cell abnormality as a result to review or complete before handoff.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
